    "official_title": "ZENITH: A Phase 3 Global, Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo-controlled Study to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Zilebesiran in Addition to Standard of Care in Reducing Major Adverse Cardiovascular Events in Adult Patients With Hypertension Not Adequately Controlled and With Either Established Cardiovascular Disease or High Risk for Cardiovascular Disease",
